## AUTH — COGNITO

| Item | Valor |
|---|---|
| User Pool ID | `us-east-2_SOCtEIx2s` |
| App Client ID | `4fjbm9cornhgfqk4o8m33rjt2f` |
| Region | `us-east-2` |
| Cognito URL | `https://cognito-idp.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/` |
| reCAPTCHA site key | `6LdVG1kpAAAAAG4z0dvxKCLcjd6Nc0miq5ObHLWy` |

### Auth Flow
1. Usuario ingresa email + password
2. Frontend obtiene reCAPTCHA token
3. SRP Auth (`USER_SRP_AUTH`) con `ValidationData: {captcha: token}`
4. PreAuthentication Lambda valida reCAPTCHA
5. SRP challenge/response
6. Tokens: IdToken (`TOKEN_EXPEI`), AccessToken (`TOKEN_ACCESS`), RefreshToken (`TOKEN_REFRESH`)
7. Tokens en `sessionStorage`
8. API calls con `Authorization: Bearer <idToken>` via axios

### Cognito Config
- **SignUp:** DESHABILITADO (`"SignUp is not permitted for this user pool"`)
- **USER_PASSWORD_AUTH:** DESHABILITADO
- **USER_SRP_AUTH:** Habilitado con PreAuthentication Lambda
- **ForgotPassword:** `PreventUserExistenceErrors` ACTIVO (200 para todos los emails)
- **ForgotPassword mask:** `a***@d***` para admin@disperso.com
- **Password reset:** Via email

### Usuarios inferidos (no confirmados por enum)
- `admin@disperso.com` — mask `a***@d***` coincide
- Empleados de Tuxpan posibles

